			"notes": "## Added\n- **Boss HUD**: show vampire boss timer details (like mania, stonewrath, killer spring, etc) in hud under Vampire Helper\n\n## Changed\n- **Mania Helper**: now highlights every surface you can stand on within mania range. Also made the feature in general more reliable\n- Some performance tweaks here and there\n- We yes we using stonecutter now\n\n## Requirements\n\n| Minecraft | Odin     | Jar                    |\n|-----------|----------|------------------------|\n| 26.1      | ≥ 0.3.4  | `adrift-0.0.4-26.1.jar` |\n| 26.2      | ≥ 0.3.6  | `adrift-0.0.4-26.2.jar` |\n| 26.3      | ≥ 0.4.0  | `adrift-0.0.4-26.3.jar` |"
